WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:09.797
When Beauty awoke, her sight was blurry.

2
00:00:09.798 --> 00:00:12.930
Her ears buzzed.

3
00:00:12.931 --> 00:00:15.452
Then she heard a soft voice.

4
00:00:15.453 --> 00:00:19.398
"Beauty, please wake up."

5
00:00:19.399 --> 00:00:22.699
A gentle hand touched her forehead.

6
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.704
"Beast?" Beauty said.

7
00:00:25.705 --> 00:00:29.520
"You're back," the voice said.

8
00:00:29.521 --> 00:00:32.396
Beauty knew that voice.

9
00:00:32.397 --> 00:00:37.380
"Father?" Beauty slowly opened her eyes.

10
00:00:37.381 --> 00:00:39.745
It was him!

11
00:00:39.746 --> 00:00:43.134
Tears filled Father's eyes.

12
00:00:43.135 --> 00:00:46.933
"I'm so glad you're home."

13
00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:51.631
"How did I get here?" Beauty asked.

14
00:00:51.632 --> 00:00:56.566
"You just appeared," Father said.

15
00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:59.851
He waved a hand around the cottage.

16
00:00:59.852 --> 00:01:04.130
"Like all this food and firewood."

17
00:01:04.131 --> 00:01:07.252
"Oh!" Beauty was amazed.

18
00:01:07.253 --> 00:01:11.130
"Beast used magic to send me home.

19
00:01:11.131 --> 00:01:17.013
He showed me those things in his mirror too."

20
00:01:17.014 --> 00:01:22.696
Father looked confused. "I don't understand."

21
00:01:22.697 --> 00:01:27.021
"It's the magic of the castle," Beauty said.

22
00:01:27.022 --> 00:01:33.378
"All kinds of magical things happen there."

23
00:01:33.379 --> 00:01:39.377
Father frowned. "That evil beast and his magic.

24
00:01:39.378 --> 00:01:41.888
Did he harm you?"

25
00:01:41.889 --> 00:01:44.812
"No," Beauty said.

26
00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:49.006
"He gave me clothes and books to read.

27
00:01:49.007 --> 00:01:52.463
He fed me like a princess."

28
00:01:52.464 --> 00:01:57.294
Father shrugged. "None of that matters now.

29
00:01:57.295 --> 00:02:05.893
All that matters is this—you're home and safe."

30
00:02:05.894 --> 00:02:09.778
A few days passed.

31
00:02:09.779 --> 00:02:14.938
Beauty soon felt like herself.

32
00:02:14.939 --> 00:02:19.285
She went out to check on her garden.

33
00:02:19.286 --> 00:02:27.765
The vegetables were growing well.

34
00:02:27.766 --> 00:02:32.100
But her rosebush looked sad and sickly.

35
00:02:32.101 --> 00:02:36.897
"My rosebush needs water," she thought.

36
00:02:36.898 --> 00:02:40.911
She hurried to the well.

37
00:02:40.912 --> 00:02:45.225
On her way she saw men heading to the forest.

38
00:02:45.226 --> 00:02:50.688
They were carrying axes and saws.

39
00:02:50.689 --> 00:02:54.942
"Woodcutters," Beauty thought.

40
00:02:54.943 --> 00:02:57.903
"Autumn is coming soon.

41
00:02:57.904 --> 00:03:04.614
We're lucky Beast gave us so much firewood."

42
00:03:04.615 --> 00:03:09.911
Suddenly she froze.

43
00:03:09.912 --> 00:03:14.819
"Beast saved me," she thought.

44
00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:19.485
"He also gave us food and firewood.

45
00:03:19.486 --> 00:03:22.877
He's awful, but . . ."

46
00:03:22.878 --> 00:03:28.405
Maybe he wasn't awful all the time.

